Root cause: portalStop() called stopWebPortal() then stopConfigPortal(); the second shutdown dereferences the freed server (WiFiManager 2.0.17 WiFiManager.cpp:970). Fixed: single stopWebPortal(). Sim reproduces (test_sim_wifi, RED 3/4 crash, GREEN 4/4).
Helper connect (Hammerspoon restart 22:5x) did not appear in the reset log as its own reset.
